{"availability":"available","full":"pawan-joshee/math_equation_editor","name":"math_equation_editor","description":"A web based Flutter application for creating and editing mathematical equations with real-time LaTeX rendering.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Dart","stars":1,"forks":1,"created":"2024-12-16T12:56:15Z","updated":"2025-02-15T10:07:18Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://math-equation-editor.web.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:22:23.890Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T03:22:23.890Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T03:22:23.890Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:22:23.890Z","stars":1,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A web based Flutter application for creating and editing mathematical equations with real-time LaTeX rendering.","Math Equation Editor is a Flutter application designed to simplify the creation and editing of mathematical equations. With an intuitive interface and real-time rendering, users can input equations using LaTeX syntax and see the results instantly. The app leverages powerful packages like fluttermathfork for LaTeX rendering and flutterbloc for state management. It also includes custom utilities for scalable brackets and equation parsing, enhancing the user experience."],"features":["Intuitive Equation Editor: User-friendly interface supporting LaTeX syntax for complex equations.","Real-Time Rendering: Instant visual feedback as you type your mathematical expressions.","Scalable Brackets: Dynamic bracket sizing implemented in scalablebrackets.dart.","State Management: Efficient state handling using the BLoC pattern with flutterbloc.","Persistent Storage: Save and load your equations with sharedpreferences."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pawan-joshee/math_equation_editor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ddfe79c1ddedb85408703ffc7b35da9b44ed56e99f2f7440111fcc35b15ca994","extractedAt":"2026-10-10